WEBVTT

00:13:29.246 --> 00:13:31.996
Most organizations don't even
have a name for it,

00:13:31.996 --> 00:13:33.871
much less a way to get people through it.

00:13:34.454 --> 00:13:36.954
And because they're in a hurry
to get the change finished,

00:13:37.329 --> 00:13:40.746
they figure that the best way to deal
with this in between time is to rush

00:13:40.746 --> 00:13:45.621
through it. Here's where you need to
distinguish train from transition.

00:13:46.162 --> 00:13:48.412
It's true that you need to
keep the change moving,

00:13:48.871 --> 00:13:52.246
but to try to hurry through the transition
gets you into trouble.

00:13:52.996 --> 00:13:56.746
It is in the neutral zone that the
real transformations take place

00:13:57.121 --> 00:14:00.496
and that energy, purpose and
commitment are renewed.